    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Troubleshooting\nThe conversion runs `ddc convert` (free tool `ddc-tools` of this repository). Install it once:\n`pip install \"C:\\DDC\\cad2data-Revit-IFC-DWG\\ddc-tools\"`\n`path_to_converters` must be the folder `DDC_WINDOWS_Converters` of this repository. `ddc convert` calls the command-line converters `cli\\RVTconverter.exe` (RVT), the IFC to Excel runtime (IFC) or `cli\\dwg2excel.exe` (DWG), never the desktop apps. Errors are printed by `ddc` in the output of the node.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
